# Local MongoDB dumps taken before schema-affecting migrations
.backup/

# Docs/ is local-only research and source material: RP1 Arena product screenshots,
# third-party benchmark captures, the resume, and the house design tokens. It never
# ships, and the seed already treats it as dev-only (src/endpoints/seed/case-studies/media.ts).
# A clone without Docs/ still builds and serves the site: theme.css is committed, and
# /design is dynamic (it awaits searchParams) so it is not prerendered. What such a clone
# cannot do is `pnpm tokens:build`, seed, or open /design — all three read Docs/ from disk.
Docs/

# Legacy SQLite database from before the MongoDB migration (37b1539)
portfolio.db
